#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
fsmentor - File System Mentor
Educational CLI helper for Linux filesystem hierarchy and Debian package management.
Designed for beginners and professionals on Debian/Ubuntu/Kali and similar systems.

Zero external dependencies. Instant. No history storage.

A full conversational AI agent version is planned for a later release.
This CLI stays lightweight and educational.

Usage examples:
  fsmentor                     # Friendly overview
  fsmentor fhs                 # Full FHS explanation
  fsmentor path /usr/bin       # Explain a path
  fsmentor cmd ls              # Explain a command (enhanced which)
  fsmentor pkg nginx           # Explain a package
  fsmentor install htop        # Explain then offer to install
  fsmentor search python3      # Search packages
  fsmentor owner /usr/bin/ls   # Which package owns this file?
  fsmentor why /var/log        # Quick “why is this here?”
"""

